  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "01K07ENG0000000000000000S1",
      "number": "1",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "동기화 알고리즘",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B001",
          "text": "에디터는 블록 단위 PATCH를 ETag와 함께 전송한다. 서버는 충돌 시 412 Precondition Failed를 반환하고, 클라이언트는 마지막 스냅샷으로 롤백 후 재시도한다."
        },
        {
          "type": "math",
          "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B002",
          "expression": "P_{conflict} \\approx 1 - e^{-\\lambda \\cdot t}",
          "display": "block"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B003",
          "variant": "danger",
          "title": "주의 — 단일 작가 가정",
          "text": "이 알고리즘은 동시 작가가 ≤ 2명이라는 전제 위에 동작한다. 실시간 협업이 필요하면 Phase 2의 CRDT 트랙을 따라야 한다."
        }
      ],
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "01K07ENG0000000000000000S2",
          "number": "1.1",
          "level": 2,
          "title": "프로토콜 시퀀스",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "flow",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B004",
              "engine": "mermaid",
              "source": "sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Client\n  participant A as API\n  participant D as DB\n  C->>A: PATCH /documents/:slug/blocks/:id (If-Match)\n  A->>D: SELECT etag FROM documents\n  alt etag matches\n    A->>D: UPDATE content_json\n    A-->>C: 200 + new etag + snapshot\n  else mismatch\n    A-->>C: 412 Precondition Failed\n  end"
            },
            {
              "type": "flow",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B005",
              "engine": "mermaid",
              "source": "graph LR\n  Q[유저 입력] --> P[Pending Patch]\n  P --> S{ETag 검증}\n  S -- OK --> A[Apply Snapshot]\n  S -- 412 --> R[로컬 롤백]\n  R --> P\n  A --> N[다음 입력]"
            }
          ],
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "01K07ENG0000000000000000S3",
          "number": "1.2",
          "level": 2,
          "title": "구현 코드",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B006",
              "language": "typescript",
              "filename": "patchBlock.ts",
              "code": "export async function patchBlock(slug: string, blockId: string, next: Block, etag: string, summary?: string) {\n  const res = await api.patch<{ document: Document; etag: string }>(\n    `/documents/${slug}/blocks/${blockId}`,\n    { block: next, summary },\n    { headers: { 'If-Match': etag } },\n  )\n  return { document: res.data.document, etag: res.headers['etag'] ?? '' }\n}"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B007",
              "language": "python",
              "filename": "documents.py",
              "code": "@router.patch('/{slug}/blocks/{block_id}')\nasync def patch_block(slug: str, block_id: str, body: PatchBody, if_match: str = Header(...)):\n    async with session_scope() as s:\n        cur = await s.execute(SELECT_DOC_FOR_UPDATE, {'slug': slug})\n        doc = cur.one()\n        if doc.etag != if_match:\n            raise HTTPException(412, 'ETag mismatch')\n        new_doc = replace_block(doc.content_json, block_id, body.block)\n        new_etag = sha256(new_doc).hexdigest()[:16]\n        await s.execute(UPDATE_DOC, {'slug': slug, 'content': json.dumps(new_doc), 'etag': new_etag})\n        return {'document': new_doc, 'etag': new_etag}"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B008",
              "language": "sql",
              "filename": "schema.sql",
              "code": "ALTER TABLE documents\n  ADD COLUMN etag TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '';\nCREATE INDEX idx_documents_etag ON documents (slug, etag);"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B009",
              "language": "bash",
              "filename": "smoke_test.sh",
              "code": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -e\nETAG=$(curl -sI \"$API/documents/$SLUG\" | awk -F': ' '/etag/{print $2}' | tr -d '\\r')\ncurl -X PATCH \"$API/documents/$SLUG/blocks/$BID\" \\\n  -H \"If-Match: $ETAG\" \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"block\":{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":\"'$BID'\",\"text\":\"hello\"}}'"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "id": "01K07ENG00000000000000B010",
              "language": "yaml",
              "filename": ".github/workflows/api.yml",
              "code": "name: api-ci\non: [push]\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - run: pnpm install\n      - run: pnpm --filter @mx/api test"
            }
          ],
